Revision history for Selecto-Components

Unreleased
    - The explorer retargets its row grain: a detail view whose columns all
      come from one to-many association shows that association's rows, a
      summary that reads one to-many association drills down into the rows
      it counted, and a "Rows of" picker lists the domain's declared
      retarget targets and swaps the pickers to the target's fields. The
      rows_of URL parameter carries the grain. Requires Selecto with
      Query->retarget.

0.1.0  2026-09-30
    - First CPAN release: Mojolicious plugin providing the Selecto explorer,
      canned search pages, dashboards, record editor, row and selected-row
      actions, and the API Console over htmx 4 WebSockets with GET/POST
      fallbacks.
    - Native-template pages (Selecto::Components::Templates) moved to the
      separate optional Selecto-Components-Templates add-on.
    - Licensed under the Artistic License 2.0.
    - Strict Content-Security-Policy clean: no inline styles; heat and rollup
      cells use shared theme classes and host theme colours load from a
      validated same-origin stylesheet (Selecto::Components::ThemeStylesheet).
